Subject: wrtkey.f: recognise ALLVEC, so it no longer needs DEBUG

WHAT IT FIXES
  MOPAC 7 implements ALLVEC in matou1.f -- `ALLPRT=(INDEX(KEYWRD,'ALLVEC')
  .NE.0)` makes it print every molecular orbital instead of a sixteen-root
  window around the HOMO -- and then never lists it in wrtkey.f, the routine
  that walks the keyword line and stops on anything it does not know:

          UNRECOGNIZED KEY-WORDS: ( ALLVEC)
          CALCULATION STOPPED TO AVOID WASTING TIME.
          IF THESE ARE DEBUG KEYWORDS, ADD THE KEYWORD "DEBUG"

  So the only way to get the whole coefficient matrix out of MOPAC 7 is to
  add DEBUG as well -- and DEBUG is also what arms the per-iteration
  eigenvector dump, because iter.f reads

          PRTVEC=( INDEX(KEYWRD,'VECT') .NE. 0  .AND. DEBUG)

  and then prints the entire NORBS x NORBS matrix on EVERY SCF cycle. The
  final block that a consumer actually reads is one of them; the other
  eighteen are the cost. Measured on paclitaxel, 299 orbitals, 19 cycles:
  22.2 MiB of listing where the converged block is 1.2 MiB.

  ALLVEC is a keyword of the program, not a debug switch. wrtkey.f simply
  never got the line.

WHAT IT DOES
  Adds the one MYWORD call that consumes ALLVEC and the FORMAT that echoes
  it, in the same shape as the VECTORS line directly above. MYWORD blanks the
  whole word out of ALLKEY, which is what keeps the end-of-routine
  "UNRECOGNIZED KEY-WORDS" test from firing. Label 211 was free.

  'VECT' is tested first and 'ALLVEC' does not contain 'VECT', so the two do
  not interfere in either order. Nothing else in the program reads ALLVEC, and
  DEBUG keeps every meaning it had: a deck that carries it still gets the
  per-iteration dump.

--- a/wrtkey.f
+++ b/wrtkey.f
@@ -28,6 +28,7 @@
      2         ,10X,''          AUSTIN, TEXAS, 78712'')')
       ENDIF
       IF (MYWORD(ALLKEY,'VECT') ) WRITE(6,210)
+      IF (MYWORD(ALLKEY,'ALLVEC') ) WRITE(6,211)
       IF (MYWORD(ALLKEY,' EXTE') ) THEN
          I=INDEX(KEYWRD,' EXTE')
          J=INDEX(KEYWRD(I:),'=')+I
@@ -456,6 +457,7 @@
   200 FORMAT(' *  PRNT     - EXTRA PRINTING IN EF ROUTINE')
 C ***********************************************************
   210 FORMAT(' *  VECTORS  - FINAL EIGENVECTORS TO BE PRINTED')
+  211 FORMAT(' *  ALLVEC   - EVERY EIGENVECTOR TO BE PRINTED')
   220 FORMAT(' *  EXTERNAL - USE ATOMIC PARAMETERS FROM THE FOLLOWING '
      1,'FILE',/15X,A)
   230 FORMAT(' *  DENSITY  - FINAL DENSITY MATRIX TO BE PRINTED')
